<title>USA: IDEC stake upped by SmithKline Beecham.</title>
<headline>IDEC stake upped by SmithKline Beecham.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by SmithKline Beecham Plc said Friday it raised its stake in IDEC Pharmaceuticals Corp to 2,040,860 commons shares or 11.3 percent stake.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 390,000 additional common shares bought between December 2 and December 4 at prices ranging from $24.19 to $25.55 per share.</p>
</text>
